+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Graphics adapter protocol. The real libsail drives the title's adapter
+ * callbacks (CellSailGraphicsAdapterFuncs: makeup, cleanup, formatChanged,
+ * alloc, free) and the title pulls pictures with GraphicsAdapterGetFrame.
